## Internationalization

### Translation Keys
```dart
import '../../../core/lang/context_tr.dart';
import '../../../core/lang/locale_keys.dart';

// Use translation helper
Text(context.tr(LocaleKeys.profile))
Text(context.tr('error.creating.post'))

// For dynamic values
Text(context.tr('posts.count', args: {'count': postsCount}))
```

### Translation Files
- Primary language: Spanish (ES)
- Update translations in: `lib/core/lang/translations/es/`
- Backend error codes must match translation keys

## Performance

### Optimizations
- Use const constructors when possible
- Implement ListView.builder for long lists
- Use Hero widgets for shared element transitions
- Lazy load images with caching
- Paginate all list views

### Future Improvements
- Implement pull-to-refresh
- Add infinite scroll
- Cache user profiles
- Preload adjacent posts

## Testing

### Widget Tests
- Test state changes in Cubits
- Verify optimistic updates and rollback
- Test navigation flows
- Mock services and repositories

### Integration Tests
- Test full user flows (view profile → view post → comment)
- Verify pagination works
- Test like/save interactions

## Security

### User Data
- Never log sensitive information
- Clear secure storage on logout
- Validate user ownership before delete/edit

### Input Validation
- Sanitize user input before sending to backend
- Validate file sizes before upload
- Check image dimensions

